WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.270
Ageha!

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:07.650
You don't have to be so loud.
I can hear you just fine.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:10.900
U-Um, th-there are SAT officers right o-outside!

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:13.690
Huh?!

00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:17.910
Move out!

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.590
Hand over Sudou Cecil.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:31.570
This is rather aggressive.

00:00:31.570 --> 00:00:33.090
Isn't this an abuse of authority?

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:35.590
We won't allow an unwarranted search!

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:37.940
You can't just barge in
whenever you want!

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:39.560
Where's your warrant?

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.720
You know, I heard Shizumu is a Wud too.

00:00:41.720 --> 00:00:43.850
We should be able to talk this out, then.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:47.300
He totally ignored us!

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.460
Unforgivable! Just go home!

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.110
Seize all of them!

00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:55.740
No way! The police are at the firm?

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.530
Sudou, Hotaru, get out of here.

00:01:08.530 --> 00:01:09.450
Hachimitsu!

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:10.580
No!

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:11.960
...B-But everyone's...

00:01:13.530 --> 00:01:15.720
I'll stay behind instead.

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:17.040
You and Hotaru
should hurry and leave.

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.310
...Nana Genie...

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:19.140
Let's go!

00:01:19.810 --> 00:01:20.970
Don't do anything rash.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.640
Take care!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:27.320
Cecilcchi! Hotarin!

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:30.310
Over here!

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:41.400
...You little...

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:44.830
Don't let her get away!

00:01:51.050 --> 00:01:52.040
Hachimitsu!

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.670
Stop resisting!

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:57.670
...Just keep running, Sudou...

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:00.080
The roads have checkpoints.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:01.680
We'll move by train.

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:03.020
What about your precog abilities?

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:04.050
Were you able to find a way around this?

00:02:04.050 --> 00:02:07.620
Of course!
Tsunomin's secured the target.

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:10.310
We even got them to tell us
who's behind all this!

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.620
The one behind this?

00:02:11.620 --> 00:02:12.460
Who is it?

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.180
Sudou Cecil!

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:26.160
We have a subpoena. Come quietly.

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:27.780
...Shizumu...

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.660
We won't let you take Cecil!

00:02:30.050 --> 00:02:32.420
We'll have to use force, then.

00:02:41.590 --> 00:02:42.500
Natcchi!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:43.220
Cecilcchi!

00:02:46.550 --> 00:02:47.680
Sori!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:49.680
Assistant Inspector Shizumu is a wizard?

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:51.480
What the hell?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:53.680
Sori! Sori!

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.320
Cecilcchi... Run!

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.490
So it's true that you're
in Macal, Shizumu.

00:03:03.480 --> 00:03:05.360
...I wanted to believe you...

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.060
...The time at Shinobazu Pond...

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:13.000
You were so nice to me,
...and you even offered to help me out...

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:15.820
Seize her.

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.630
...B-But...

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.350
Are you not going to
follow my orders?

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:25.940
I have one question.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:27.350
Assistant Inspector Shizumu,
...are you a wi—

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.530
...Just, please...

00:03:38.260 --> 00:03:39.480
come with me.

00:03:39.480 --> 00:03:41.980
...Otherwise, I...

00:03:49.210 --> 00:03:50.380
No!

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:00.460
Cecil!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:09.970
I'm sorry.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:17.810
I will carry my indomitable hope into the dark night

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:17.810
yami no naka no shinjitsu ga hikari kagayaku you ni

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:24.080
so that it may light a shining fire of truth there

00:04:18.060 --> 00:04:24.080
kagi no nai kibou wo tokihanatou

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:39.970
I was born bleeding from my hands,

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:39.970
naze te no hira no kizu wo daite umareochita imi

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.590
and why was I born not a thousand years in the past or the future,

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.590
sennen kako demo mirai demo naku

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.050
but in the present?

00:04:43.850 --> 00:04:45.050
erabareta ima

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:49.100
The scales of justice are fragile

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:49.100
zen'aku hakaru tenbin wa zeijaku

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:54.480
The waning, waxing moon calls to a flower on the earth

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:54.480
michikakeru tsuki ga izanau gisei no chi ni saita

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.230
the color of blood

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:56.230
chi no iro no hana

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.710
I will give all I have

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:58.710
tatta hitotsu kanau nara

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.410
if it means one of my wishes will come true

00:04:58.710 --> 00:05:01.410
subete wo sasageyou

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.570
I have a "post nubila phoebus" kind of personality

00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:04.570
post nubila phoebus kokoro

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.570
which I will show the world

00:05:04.770 --> 00:05:06.570
kaze ni hanate

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.540
I want to slash apart the curtain of raven black,

00:05:06.570 --> 00:05:09.540
shikkoku no curtain hikichigiri

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:12.230
and look at a new world

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:12.230
chigau sora wo mitemitai

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.900
I put my love into the cracks

00:05:12.230 --> 00:05:14.900
sabita unmei no hibiware

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.370
of a stagnant fate

00:05:14.900 --> 00:05:17.370
omoi wo nejikonde

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.230
No matter how long the storm lasts,

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.230
donnani arasoi tsuzuketemo

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.840
time itself will not stop breathing

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.840
toki wa kokyuu wo yamenai

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.600
What remains after destruction, rebirth,

00:05:23.050 --> 00:05:25.600
kowashite tsunde kowashite

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.070
and further destruction?

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:28.070
nani ga nokoru darou

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.800
I'm sure the starlit sky can put an end

00:05:28.070 --> 00:05:30.800
sou nanajuuoku mo no mayoi hoshi

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.940
to the system of the world

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.940
sono haichizu wa kakikaerareru

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:36.560
I'm sure that one day I will find a place where I can shine

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:36.560
moetsukitemo kagayakeru basho he

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.850
even if only ashes will remain

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:40.850
itsuka tadoritsukeru

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:48.990
Case 11

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:48.990
Shining Cecil

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.020
This is for Cecillun.

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:10.530
Be grateful.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:31.660
She regained consciousness?

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.130
How is this possible?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:38.920
<i>So is this a good day or a bad day?</i>

00:06:43.780 --> 00:06:46.930
...Butterfly... was right...

00:06:52.520 --> 00:06:54.430
I trust you won't be greedy, Katasue.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:06:59.810
It's me.

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:05.320
Really? Good job.

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.070
We made it in time.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:17.080
...The only thing I can do is...

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.210
Glory to Macal.

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:24.590
Punish Labone.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.140
Prosperity to Macal.

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:30.790
May humankind
suffer many years of pain.

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:31.850
It's finally time.

00:07:37.480 --> 00:07:39.850
We shall now begin
the summoning ritual.

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:48.080
Glory to Macal.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:50.810
Punish Labone.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.750
Prosperity to Macal.

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.590
Tsunomin!

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.370
A-Are you okay?

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.360
Where's Cecilcchi?

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:38.810
S-Sorry... Shizumu got her.

00:08:38.810 --> 00:08:39.750
Huh?

00:08:39.750 --> 00:08:41.150
...H-Hey, check it out...

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:42.090
...What's that...

00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:45.170
...L-Look...

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:02.600
What's going on?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.810
What's that?

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:09.110
Hey, look at that.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.570
<i>It's finally begun.</i>

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.370
Let us become one.

00:09:53.520 --> 00:09:56.330
The catalyst will no longer be human.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.160
Hey, let's become one.

00:10:09.160 --> 00:10:12.500
What do you mean?

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.190
It'll be fun.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:17.130
This whole world will be yours.

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.410
...But...

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.140
You can't refuse.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:34.930
At last... At long last!

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.400
Sudou Cecil!

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:41.660
Only your rare magical powers can
entice the Archangel Lucifer.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.310
Using your body, he will descend.

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:46.660
Archangel Lucifer!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:50.920
Give your strength to me—your
summoner—Makusu Shimon!

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:06.590
Cecil!

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:11.020
Come forth, Lucifer!

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:25.030
Are you the one who
calls me, Makusu Shimon?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:27.450
Indeed, Lucifer.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:29.290
Now, give me your strength!

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.670
There's something
you need to know, Makusu.

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:36.210
I already descended
to this world six years ago.

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:36.990
What?

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:43.460
When you used your summoning magic to
bring the eleven-year-old Cecil back to life.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:44.870
What?

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:47.810
Living as a human is quite entertaining.

00:11:47.810 --> 00:11:50.710
I am your summoner.

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:52.540
...Hear my wish...

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:54.370
Give me your power!

00:11:54.810 --> 00:12:00.220
Under normal circumstances,
I would give my summoner my power,

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:02.950
but I'd like to give that power to Cecil.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.450
Cecil is fascinating.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.700
Nonsense!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.410
Do you know how many
sacrifices I've made?

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:14.460
These were all to avenge
Macal's years of hatred!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:19.590
I don't care what happens to the balance
between the humans and the Wuds.

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:24.610
As long as I have Cecil, I'm satisfied.

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:29.100
The nobility of her soul is unmatched.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:34.600
So you're going to choose this brat over
the Demon World's rules and me, Lucifer?

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.730
You wouldn't understand.

00:12:38.620 --> 00:12:40.550
We shall now become one.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:44.860
Cecil!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.730
Shizumu!

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.540
...I-Impossible...

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.310
It disappeared.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.230
...Cecil...

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.990
...Shizumu...

00:13:25.780 --> 00:13:27.210
I made it in time.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:31.110
I'm sorry I put you through all this.

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.230
...But...

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.380
It's all right now.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:37.360
Okay.

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.880
How many times did I tell you this ritual
could only be done once every hundred years?

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.600
You fool!

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.470
...Director Makusu...

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:59.150
You're the one behind all this?

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:00.810
...Cecil...

00:14:01.340 --> 00:14:03.460
Blood! There's blood!

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:07.070
I don't have the right to keep this.

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.920
Shizumu... Shizumu!

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.190
Both Lucifer and Shizumu
...fell for the likes of you...

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.670
A foolish little girl like you is worthless!

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:31.190
...Laws...

00:14:31.880 --> 00:14:34.640
Aren't laws supposed to be upheld?

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:39.470
Now humans will hate the Wuds again.

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:42.900
You just committed a sin
worse than any other!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.860
Just try and kill me, you brat!

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:50.410
<i>Makusu Metamoloid... Go!</i>

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:53.780
<i>Cecil Diaboloid... Go!</i>

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.710
...We can't do this here...

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.160
Don't think you can escape!

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:42.630
If a guardian of the law
breaks it like it means nothing,

00:15:42.630 --> 00:15:46.420
then that will only anger humans more,
and cause the Wuds sadness!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:03.670
Do it, Cecilun!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.190
Kick Makusu's ass!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:16.990
Why are you using
your authority for evil?

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.580
You're a Wud and you
still don't understand?

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:23.370
Throughout history, humans have
trampled on and discriminated against us.

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:27.290
This is the time for all wizards
to take over the world!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.180
It seems that's all you've got.

00:17:09.880 --> 00:17:11.250
You foolish girl.

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:13.870
This is what you get for humiliating me!

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:16.110
Beg for forgiveness in Hell!

00:17:18.700 --> 00:17:20.060
...If I don't do something...

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:23.930
What?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.250
Cecil!

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:30.590
Cecilcchi!

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:32.330
Cecilcchi!

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:34.870
Natcchi! Tsunomin! Sori!

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:42.240
You little bitch!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.580
The metal won't last in this cold!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:27.210
Looks like your second-rate magic
is no match for mine!

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:34.130
Say your prayers, Cecil!

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.910
It shattered!

00:19:04.420 --> 00:19:07.110
...<i>I'm done for...</i>

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:16.570
<i>I'm flying?</i>

00:19:16.570 --> 00:19:17.610
...<i>No way...</i>

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.530
Cecilcchi!

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:49.870
Why did you save me?

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:54.010
The law must judge you.

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:57.870
Please let the truth be known
in the Court for Magic!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:07.640
Shizumu died?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.450
He was found shot to death.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:14.150
Due to the diaboloids, we could
not recover any evidence at the scene.

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:16.440
The investigation will
most likely be difficult.

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.630
...I see...

00:20:18.480 --> 00:20:19.950
You can leave now.

00:20:27.600 --> 00:20:30.160
What on Earth were you
trying to do, Shizumu?

00:20:34.180 --> 00:20:37.170
You don't have to worry, Dad.
Everything's fine now.

00:20:37.170 --> 00:20:42.210
I've been hiding something that
happened six years ago from you.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.290
I'd like to tell you now.

00:20:44.860 --> 00:20:45.680
Okay.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.220
I see.

00:20:50.220 --> 00:20:53.530
It all started from the
...incident six years ago...

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.990
Everything was planned by Makusu.

00:20:57.660 --> 00:20:58.690
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:00.470
...Because of me...

00:21:01.130 --> 00:21:03.170
...Because of my magic...

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:05.570
You ended up a criminal.

00:21:06.340 --> 00:21:09.350
I'm so sorry.

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:12.000
It isn't your fault, Cecil.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.180
The one who's culpable
is Makusu, isn't that right?

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:15.960
...But...

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:19.210
Just keep your head up.

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:21.650
Okay.

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:26.930
If... If Makusu were to tell
the truth at his impeachment,

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:29.870
we might be able to get a retrial.

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:32.540
So just wait for me, Mom.

00:21:32.540 --> 00:21:33.470
I will.

00:21:34.140 --> 00:21:38.480
Also, don't be too hard on your father.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:43.050
Yeah. He <i>did just want
to bring me back to life.</i>

00:21:43.050 --> 00:21:45.670
So he agreed to use
Makusu's summoning magic.

00:21:46.180 --> 00:21:48.590
That was a trap, as well.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:54.350
Yes, I'm still at the jail.

00:21:54.350 --> 00:21:56.630
Hurry back to the office, Cecil!

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.130
What's wrong?

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.890
...We just got a call...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.810
Makusu asked if you would
defend him at his impeachment.

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:33.130
Tears may drench the skies of my heart,

00:22:25.830 --> 00:22:33.130
kokoro no sora ni namida afuretemo

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:40.500
but I still want to behold the blue outside

00:22:33.130 --> 00:22:40.500
hitomi ni aozora utsushiteitai

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:47.890
I want to have something like the strength of flowers

00:22:40.500 --> 00:22:47.890
concrete-iro no machi no katasumi ni

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:55.220
which bloom in the nooks of the endless concrete of the city

00:22:47.890 --> 00:22:55.220
sotto saku hana no tsuyosa wo manetai

00:22:55.310 --> 00:23:02.820
Starting today, I won't try to wriggle out by saying

00:22:55.310 --> 00:23:02.820
maegami ga jama de mienai nante iiwake

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:07.070
that I saw nothing because my hair was in the way

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:07.070
kyou kara shinai

00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:15.000
Beyond the horizon, my future awaits me,

00:23:07.450 --> 00:23:15.000
chiheisen no mukou ni ashita ga matteru kara

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:20.210
so I will let the sun in my heart

00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:20.210
kono mune mou hitotsu no taiyou

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.260
shine out far and wide

00:23:20.210 --> 00:23:22.260
tooku hanatte

00:23:22.260 --> 00:23:29.640
I will overtake the earth's rotation on the path I walk,

00:23:22.260 --> 00:23:29.640
chikyuu no jiten wo oikosu kurai hitamuki ni arukou

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:37.870
with trusting love inside my heart

00:23:29.640 --> 00:23:37.870
shinjiru omoi dakishimete doko made mo
